  ],
  "limits": [
    "No browser UI tests or manual acceptance were run, per user instruction. Headless checks and compilation do not establish actual native AX/focus/observer behavior, rendering parity, memory improvement or presentation speedup.",
    "Existing preview was left unchanged. Selectors, editor/text/popup models, scene properties/parenting and native hierarchy/layout are not migrated by this change. Input/model IDs remain local to their scope and do not authorize browser operations.",
    "Typed payloads use optional indirection to avoid embedding large models into every action record. Their memory/time cost has not been benchmarked. Native event/AX/window/font/Metal and command services remain explicit adapters.",
    "Full Rust scene-tree/model ownership, incremental native adapter reconciliation, complete GUI/manual checks, CPU/GPU/presentation profiling, compositor diagnostics and final release/license acceptance remain open.",
    "Frozen UI-lab bootstrap/network inputs exclude current-main network policy."
  ],
